@startuml cgms_sensor_state
title CGMS Sensor Lifecycle State Machine

[*] --> Manufacturing

Manufacturing --> Stored : packaged
Stored --> Activated : user applies sensor
Activated --> WarmUp : power on

WarmUp --> Measuring : stabilization complete
Measuring --> Measuring : periodic sample

Measuring --> Calibration : calibration requested
Calibration --> Measuring : calibration successful

Measuring --> Fault : sensor error
Calibration --> Fault : calibration failure

Fault --> Measuring : recoverable fault
Fault --> Expired : unrecoverable fault

Measuring --> Expired : wear-time exceeded
Expired --> [*]

note right of Measuring
Normal operation
Sampling every 1–5 minutes
end note

note right of Fault
Triggers user alert
Disables insulin automation
end note

@enduml
